<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/ArchitecturalStyle#Stupa> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Deprecated in HeritageGraph 1.1.0: A building type, not an architectural style: type the structure as a Stupa instead."@en .
