<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/HereditaryRoleTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Time-bounded holding of a hereditary ritual duty by a person or caste group, under the mandate of a Guthi, with the rule by which the duty passes on. The same period pattern as KumariTenure, applied to hereditary offices (priests, chariot builders, musicians)."@en .
